<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={siteUrl} />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content={company.name} />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={siteUrl} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={company.name} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
    <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="마이너스베타스튜디오 — Tools Worth Keeping." />

    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={company.name} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage} />

    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090A" />
    <title>{company.name}</title>
    <script is:inline src="/mb-components.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <mb-header active="home" tone="studio"></mb-header>
    <main>
      <div class="page-shell">
      <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <img class="hero-mark" src="/minusbeta-badge.svg" alt="" width="640" height="640" aria-hidden="true" />
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">1인 스튜디오 · 강대종</p>
            <h1 id="page-title"><span>마이너스</span><span>베타스튜디오</span></h1>
            <p class="tagline">{slogan}</p>
            <p class="lead">{sloganKo} 모바일 앱, 작은 웹 서비스, 공개 자동화 도구를 직접 만들고 검증하며 운영합니다.</p>
            <ul class="hero-pills" aria-label="지금 운영 중인 것">
              <li>출시 앱 {apps.length}</li>
              <li>웹 서비스 1</li>
              <li>공개 도구 {tools.length}</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="hero-products" aria-label="지금 운영 중인 웹 서비스">웹 · {featured.name}</p>
            <p class="hero-products" aria-label="지금 운영 중인 앱">앱 · {productNames.join(" · ")}</p>
            <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="주요 링크">
              <a class="button primary" href={company.products}>제품 보기</a>
              <a class="button" href={company.work}>작업장 보기</a>
              <a class="button" href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>문의하기</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figure class="hero-figure">
            <img src="/studio/hero-desk.jpg" alt="창가에서 리포트를 읽는 장면" width="1600" height="900" />
            <figcaption>첫이름 · 사주운세 리포트</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="proof-strip" aria-label="스튜디오 요약">
        <div class="proof-inner">
          {proofPoints.map((item) => (
            <div>
              <span>{item.label}</span>
              <strong>{item.value}</strong>
              <p>{item.desc}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="focus-section" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">하는 일</p>
            <h2 id="focus-title">혼자 만들지만, 혼자만 보지 않습니다.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>{intro} 작게 만들고, 바로 내보내고, 기록으로 다시 줄입니다.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="focus-list">
          {focusAreas.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <span>{item.number}</span>
              <strong>{item.title}</strong>
              <p>{item.desc}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="products-section" aria-labelledby="products-title">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">제품</p>
            <h2 id="products-title">지금 쓸 수 있는 것들</h2>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href={company.products}>전체 제품 보기</a>
        </div>
        <article class="product-card featured">
          <img class="featured-photo" src="/studio/cheotireum.jpg" alt="첫이름 작명 서비스" width="1050" height="1400" />
          <div class="featured-copy">
            <span>{featured.status}</span>
            <p class="featured-kicker">{featured.kicker}</p>
            <h3>{featured.name}</h3>
            <p>{featured.desc}</p>
            <div class="link-row">
              {featured.links.map((link) => (
                <a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{link.label} →</a>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="product-grid">
          {apps.map((app) => (
            <article class="product-card">
              <span>{app.status}</span>
              <h3>{app.name}</h3>
              <p>{app.desc}</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                {app.links.map((link) => (
                  <a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{link.label} →</a>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ebooks-section" aria-labelledby="ebooks-title">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">전자책</p>
            <h2 id="ebooks-title">운영하면서 묶은 글</h2>
          </div>
          <p>직접 굴리며 정리한 작업 흐름입니다. 이론서가 아닙니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid">
          {ebooks.map((book) => (
            <article class="product-card">
              <span>{book.status}</span>
              <h3>{book.name}</h3>
              <p>{book.desc}</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                {book.links.map((link) => (
                  <a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{link.label} →</a>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tools-section" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">공개 도구</p>
            <h2 id="tools-title">내부에서 쓰는 브릿지를 공개합니다</h2>
          </div>
          <p>폰에서 자기 컴퓨터의 AI를 부리려고 만든 도구입니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          {tools.map((tool) => (
            <article class="tool-card">
              <div class="tool-top">
                <h3>{tool.name}</h3>
                <span>{tool.status}</span>
              </div>
              <p>{tool.desc}</p>
              <div class="link-row">
                <a href={tool.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
                <a href={tool.releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Release →</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="connect-section" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">연결</p>
            <h2 id="connect-title">기록은 공개 페이지에, 연락은 메일로</h2>
          </div>
          <p>제품과 작업 과정은 작업장에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connect-list">
          {links.map((link) => (
            <a href={link.href}>
              <span>{link.label}</span>
              <strong>{link.desc}</strong>
              <em>{link.meta} →</em>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="company-section" aria-labelledby="company-title">
